# Per-ticket acceptance scripts live here.
#
# Convention: acceptance/NN.sh, where NN is the two-digit ticket number.
# claude-plan.yml generates the script content into the ticket issue body;
# Codex must copy it verbatim into this directory in its feature branch.
# sanity-check.yml runs the script as a required gate when the PR is from
# branch feature/NN-*.
